---
// Brand hero: identidad Mermelada Tech + Nai como cara visible.
---

<section
	class="merme-hero-gradient relative overflow-hidden border-b-[1.5px] border-merme-black"
>
	<!-- Pixel grid overlay -->
	<div class="absolute inset-0 merme-grid-overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>

	<!-- Decorative SVGs -->
	<img
		src="/cloud.svg"
		alt=""
		aria-hidden="true"
		class="absolute left-4 top-16 w-24 sm:w-32 h-auto brightness-0 invert opacity-90 animate-wiggle"
	/>
	<img
		src="/cloud.svg"
		alt=""
		aria-hidden="true"
		class="absolute right-6 top-24 w-28 sm:w-40 h-auto brightness-0 invert opacity-90 animate-wiggle [animation-duration:4s]"
	/>
	<img
		src="/moon.svg"
		alt=""
		aria-hidden="true"
		class="hidden sm:block absolute right-12 bottom-24 w-28 h-auto brightness-0 invert opacity-90 animate-wiggle [animation-duration:5s]"
	/>
	<img
		src="/cross.svg"
		alt=""
		aria-hidden="true"
		class="absolute left-1/4 top-10 w-5 h-auto brightness-0 invert animate-wiggle [animation-duration:2s]"
	/>

	<div
		class="relative max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pt-20 pb-24 sm:pt-28 sm:pb-32 text-center"
	>
		<span
			class="inline-block bg-white text-merme-black text-sm font-semibold border-[1.5px] border-merme-black rounded-full px-4 py-1 shadow-[var(--shadow-merme)]"
		>
			Comunidad de mujeres en tecnología
		</span>

		<h1 class="text-merme-purple text-5xl sm:text-6xl leading-[1.05] mt-6">
			Crecé en tech<br />sin perderte en el camino
		</h1>

		<p class="text-merme-black/90 font-medium text-lg sm:text-xl mt-6 max-w-xl mx-auto">
			Workshops y mentorías 1:1 con Nai Ujovich. Claridad sobre la era de la IA,
			crecimiento sin burnout y open source sin síndrome impostor.
		</p>

		<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center mt-9">
			<a href="#workshops" class="merme-btn text-lg">Ver workshops</a>
			<a href="#mentorias" class="merme-btn merme-btn--ghost text-lg">Reservá tu sesión</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
